      "title": "HTTPS certificate days remaining",
      "type": "table",
      "description": "Days until the earliest certificate expiry reported by each selected Blackbox probe. Requires a fresh successful scrape and fresh positive expiry metric, not probe_success=1. HTTP-only targets are not applicable. Missing data for an expected HTTPS check requires investigation; compare with the agreed HTTPS inventory. Negative days indicate expiry. Colours: below 3 red, 3 to below 14 orange, 14 or more green.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 41,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 9
